[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4592880968","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119936#issuecomment-4592880968","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119936","id":4592880968,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEcHNSA","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-01T13:09:34Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T13:14:42Z","body":"> Since `GDScriptFunctionState` was not present in `globals` prior to #119352 I don't see much risk.\r\n\r\nNote that `ClassDB` may contain classes not explicitly registered with `GDREGISTER_(INTERNAL_)?CLASS`. Using the `GDCLASS` macro may be sufficient to add a class to `ClassDB`. This is likely something related to `GDType`, I'm not sure when this behavior arose (in 4.6 or earlier):\r\n\r\n`4.6.2 -> master`\r\n\r\nClass                                               | `class_exists()`? | Registered?\r\n----------------------------------------------------|-------------------|----------------------------------\r\n`GDScriptFunctionState` (`GDCLASS`)                 | false[^1] -> true | No -> `GDREGISTER_INTERNAL_CLASS`\r\n`GDScriptNativeClass` (`GDCLASS`)                   | true              | No\r\n`ResourceFormatLoaderGDScript` (`GDSOFTCLASS`)      | false             | No\r\n`EditorExportGDScript` (`GDCLASS`)                  | true              | No\r\n`GDScriptEditorTranslationParserPlugin` (`GDCLASS`) | true              | No\r\n\r\nMore importantly, you're excluding not only `GDScriptFunctionState` (using `GDScriptAnalyzer::class_exists()`), but also all unexposed classes, some of which are exist in `ClassDB` and present in `globals`, even in 4.6. And not just for the GDScript module, but for the entire engine. This is a risk, albeit minimal. I think we should do this sooner or later. But for release 4.7 and fix #119935, we need to add a check to the analyzer. Removing unnecessary constants from `globals` isn't strictly necessary for this.\r\n\r\n[^1]: I don't understand why this is different from other classes. Apparently, the result is influenced not only by the macro (`GDCLASS` vs `GDSOFTCLASS`) and whether it's registered (`GDREGISTER_(INTERNAL_)?CLASS`).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4592880968/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4592964411","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119936#issuecomment-4592964411","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119936","id":4592964411,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEcMTOw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-01T13:19:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T13:19:49Z","body":"> Using the `GDCLASS` macro may be sufficient to add a class to `ClassDB`\r\n\r\nThis happens on first instantiation afaik. So it is relevant for all classes that are instantiated before `GDScriptLanguage::init`. Currently this are these for me:\r\n\r\nGDScriptEditorTranslationParserPlugin\r\nGDScriptFunctionState\r\nGLTFDocumentExtensionPhysics\r\nGLTFDocumentExtensionTextureKTX\r\nGLTFDocumentExtensionTextureWebP\r\nGodotNavigationServer2D\r\nGodotPhysicsServer2D\r\nGodotPhysicsServer3D\r\nIPUnix\r\nMovieWriterMJPEG\r\nMovieWriterOGV\r\nMovieWriterPNGWAV\r\nResourceFormatImporterSaver","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4592964411/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4592999951","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119936#issuecomment-4592999951","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119936","id":4592999951,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEcOeDw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-01T13:24:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T08:16:09Z","body":"> But for release 4.7 and fix #119935, we need to add a check to the analyzer. Removing unnecessary constants from `globals` isn't strictly necessary for this.\r\n\r\nWould be fine with me, if we move this PR to 4.8 and go for a different fix. ~In that case I'd like to slate https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119691 for 4.7 though.~","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4592999951/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4652423764","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119936#issuecomment-4652423764","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119936","id":4652423764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFU5aVA","user":{"l